# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Environ Manage (.gitignore)
# 只排除"非项目源码"的生成物与开发临时文件；仓库内保留纯源码。
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

# ---- Visual Studio / MSBuild 构建产物与缓存 ----
.vs/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
x64/
x86/
ARM64/
*.user
*.suo
*.sdf
*.opendb
*.db
*.ipch
*.aps
*.pch
*.tlog
*.iobj
*.ipdb
*.ilk
*.exp
*.pdb
*.exe
*.dll
*.lib
*.obj

# ---- 运行时生成：日志与下载缓存 ----
log/
cache/
*.log

# ---- 开发过程的一次性修补脚本（非项目源码）----
patch_*.py
fix_*.py
